OL,3,AMillions of Ebola dollars going missing
OL,4,Aas virus spreads, medical charity warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of millions of dollars meant
OL,7,Fto help tackle Ebola in the Democratic
OL,8,FRepublic of Congo are not reaching the
OL,9,Fintended recipients, a medical charity
OL,10,Fhas warned.
OL,12,FMedecins Sans Frontieres (MSF) says
OL,13,Fwhile the outbreak remains "out of
OL,14,Fcontrol", there is a "considerable
OL,15,Fdisconnect" between what is disbursed
OL,16,Fand what gets to "patients, frontline
OL,17,Fworkers and communities".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
