OL,3,AMillions of Ebola dollars going missing
OL,4,Aas virus spreads, medical charity warns
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Despite the vast amounts of money
OL,7,Fprovided for the response, many
OL,8,Ffrontline responders are left trying to
OL,9,Fcontain the outbreak with empty hands
OL,10,Fand empty pockets," the charity says in
OL,11,Fa report.
OL,13,FMore than 5,400 people have died and
OL,14,F11,000 infected with Ebola in DR Congo
OL,15,Fsince the outbreak was declared in May.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
